#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Index which landed catalog source defines which external symbol.

Compiles every genuine (non-asm) entry of rebuild/build_candidates.ps1 with the bootstrap's
flags (plus the entry's CompilerFlags) and records the external symbols each object
DEFINES, so a runtime can be closed over real reconstructions before falling back to
boundary stand-ins (see link_closure.py).

Output: rebuild/build/symbol_index.tsv  (symbol, address, source, strength)
strength is "strong" for ordinary definitions and "comdat" for COMDAT/selectany ones
(inline members, template instances, vtables) that many objects emit.

Usage: python tools/decomp_pipeline/symbol_index.py [--jobs 16] [--only SUBSTRING]
"""
